{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_12","type":"agent_message","text":"The plan will keep scheduling and effects in the existing CLJS engine, with wasm executing register control flow and holding explicit frame state. I also found superseded text in the design docs: current returns do not restore code-space snapshots, resource updates go into `:resources`, and A is the code identity while R remains the native image checksum. The plan will call out these distinctions.\n"}}
